# Frame dumps from `cargo run -p mpv-frames --example dump_frames`. The
# `--out` flag names the directory, so both defaults are listed rather than
# ignoring *.png repo-wide — that swallowed README screenshots silently, and a
# `git add` that appears to succeed and does nothing is a bad half hour.
/out
